ing table</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-2xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] bg-subtle border-line-2 text-ink-2 ml-auto shrink-0\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ink-3\"></span>Project</span></li></ol></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"btn-secondary\" href=\"/product/geo-audit\">Explore the product <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M224.49,136.49l-72,72a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L187,140H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H187L135.51,64.48a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l72,72A12,12,0,0,1,224.49,136.49Z\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-2xs text-ink-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M230.47,67.5a12,12,0,0,0-19.26-4.32L172.43,99l-12.68-2.72L157,83.57l35.79-38.78a12,12,0,0,0-4.32-19.26A76.07,76.07,0,0,0,88.41,121.64L30.92,174.18a4.68,4.68,0,0,0-.39.38,36,36,0,0,0,50.91,50.91l.38-.39,52.54-57.49A76.05,76.05,0,0,0,230.47,67.5ZM160,148a51.5,51.5,0,0,1-23.35-5.52,12,12,0,0,0-14.26,2.62L64.31,208.66a12,12,0,0,1-17-17l63.55-58.07a12,12,0,0,0,2.62-14.26A51.5,51.5,0,0,1,108,96a52.06,52.06,0,0,1,52-52h.89L135.17,71.87a12,12,0,0,0-2.91,10.65l5.66,26.35a12,12,0,0,0,9.21,9.21l26.35,5.66a12,12,0,0,0,10.65-2.91L212,95.12c0,.3,0,.59,0,.89A52.06,52.06,0,0,1,160,148Z\"></path></svg> Technical GEO, entity checks and more inside</span></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-line bg-subtle/40\"><div class=\"site-container py-16 sm:py-20\"><header class=\"max-w-2xl scroll-mt-24 \"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-3\">Social proof</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl\">Teams use GEO Tool to make the case internally</h2></header><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"reveal  \" style=\"transition-delay:0s\"><figure cla