-10 grid max-w-3xl gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border p-5 border-line bg-surface\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">Free Audit</p><p class=\"mt-1\"><span class=\"data-fig text-2xl font-bold text-ink\">$0</span><span class=\"text-2xs text-ink-3\"> <!-- -->forever</span></p><p class=\"mt-1 text-2xs text-ink-2\">See where you stand in AI search.</p><a class=\"mt-4 w-full btn-secondary h-9 text-sm\" href=\"/audit\">Run a free audit<!-- --> </a></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border p-5 border-brand bg-surface shadow-card\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-2xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] bg-brand-soft border-brand/30 text-brand-dark mb-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand\"></span>Most popular</span><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">Full GEO Report</p><p class=\"mt-1\"><span class=\"data-fig text-2xl font-bold text-ink\">$149</span><span class=\"text-2xs text-ink-3\"> <!-- -->one-time</span></p><p class=\"mt-1 text-2xs text-ink-2\">The complete audit for one domain.</p><a class=\"mt-4 w-full btn-primary h-9 text-sm\" href=\"/checkout\">Get the full report<!-- --> </a></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border p-5 border-line bg-surface\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-ink\">GEO Monitor</p><p class=\"mt-1\"><span class=\"data-fig text-2xl font-bold text-ink\">$99</span><span class=\"text-2xs text-ink-3\"> <!-- -->per month</span></p><p class=\"mt-1 text-2xs text-ink-2\">Track and improve every month.</p><button type=\"button\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"mt-4 w-full btn-secondary h-9 text-sm cursor-default justify-center opacity-80\">Start monitoring</button></div></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-center\"><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/pricing\">See full pricing and FAQ</a></p></section><section class=\"border-t border-line bg-gradient-to-b from-canvas to-brand-soft/40\"><div class=\"site-container py-16 text-center sm:py-20\"><svg xmlns=\"http:/